<title>UK: Linden shares set debut premium.</title>
<headline>Linden shares set debut premium.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in housebuilder Linden Plc set a premium in quiet trading as they made their debut on the London Stock Exchange on Thursday.</p>
<p>The shares were quoted at 164-1/2p by the close in volume of 84,550, compared with a price of 150p in a placing earlier this month with institutional investors.</p>
<p>The float raised 6.5 million stg, valuing the company at 22.8 million stg, and was sponsored by Credit Lyonnais Laing.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8712</p>
</text>
